  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5702.01 Notification of Arrest. All state, local, and county law enforcement agencies shall complete and submit arrest information on form FD-249, “Fingerprint Card” (Rev. 3-1-10) to the central repository for each person arrested for any felony, misdemeanor, or violation committed under RSA title LXII.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5700) #6704, eff 3-3-98, EXPIRED: 3-3-06\n\nNew. #8591, INTERIM, eff 3-24-06, EXPIRES: 9-20-06; ss by #8651, eff 6-2-06, EXPIRED: 6-2-14\n\nNew. #11157, INTERIM, eff 8-18-16, EXPIRED: 2-14-17\n\nNew. #12132, eff 3-17-17",
